flowchart TB
    Create[Create Profile A] --> Tabs[Open five tabs]
    Tabs --> Visit[Visit websites]
    Visit --> Bookmark[Bookmark pages]
    Bookmark --> Search[Search pages]
    Search --> Download[Download file]
    Download --> History[Check history]
    History --> Switch[Switch to Profile B]
    Switch --> Other[Open different tabs]
    Other --> Return[Return to Profile A]
    Return --> Verify[Verify tabs, bookmarks, downloads, history, and session]
    Verify --> Restart[Restart PHNX]
    Restart --> Restore[Restore Profile A and B sessions]
    Restore --> Final[Verify profile-aware state]

    classDef action fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef verify fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:1.5px
    class Create,Tabs,Visit,Bookmark,Search,Download,History,Switch,Other,Return,Restart action
    class Verify,Restore,Final verify
